    at   1.93x (STALE laptop, state B                       ) -> binary is 12.7x SLOWER
    at   4.19x (STALE laptop, state A                       ) -> binary is 5.8x SLOWER
    at  64.00x (Ampere b1 spec ceiling                      ) -> binary is 2.6x faster
