W1A16 IS NOT BINARISATION. It changes no operation: still a bf16 GEMM over a
matrix holding two values per row. Only the 'both' column corresponds to the
plan's claim, and only --scale none is strict; a per-row float scale is a float.

READ THIS BEFORE USING THE NUMBERS: projection PENALISES. A component that
survives here is strong evidence it survives from-scratch training; one that
fails here is weak evidence, because a model trained binary shapes its own
weight distribution for sign() and this one never did.
